  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to empower and provide opportunities for young women to grow, lead, infuence and take action on global priorities that are relevant to them. Activites inlcude, amongst others, awerness raising on climate change and delivering education on menstrual hygiene.The project also aims to strengthen the institutional capacity of partner organisations. Partipating countries are: Bangladesh, Burundi, Madagascar, Ghana, Kenya, Malawi, Nepal, Rwanda, Tanzania, Uganda, Zambia and Zimbabwe.</narrative>
  </description>
